LCAO (gamma-only) neutral water with periodic SCCS (water-neutral preset) and a delayed start, same input as
scf_sccs_water plus mixing_restart 1e-2, mixing_dmr 1 and sccs_start_drho 1e-3: the density-matrix mixing
starts at the mixing restart; when SCCS starts later, the mixing restarts, including the density-matrix history.
